# Loads the devenv shell. First time in this repo: run `direnv allow`.
#
# `devenv direnvrc` defines the `use devenv` integration inline, so this file
# is self-contained — no global ~/.config/direnv setup needed.
#
# Per-user .env is loaded by devenv itself (dotenv.enable in devenv.nix), so it
# applies to `devenv shell` too — no dotenv line needed here.
eval "$(devenv direnvrc)"

use devenv
